Package: libcrimlab0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: criminology and sociolegal statistics (library)
 Statistical methods for courts, corrections, policing, forensic science
 and crime places: the compiled kernels of the R and Python packages
 crimlab. This package has the shared library.

Package: libcrimlab-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libcrimlab0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: criminology and sociolegal statistics (development files)
 Statistical methods for courts, corrections, policing, forensic science
 and crime places: the compiled kernels of the R and Python packages
 crimlab. This package has the C headers.

Package: crimlab
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: criminology and sociolegal statistics (command)
 Statistical methods for courts, corrections, policing, forensic science
 and crime places: the compiled kernels of the R and Python packages
 crimlab. This package has the crimlab command, which runs every function
 of the package on JSON or CSV input.
